{
  "description": "KB7: recipe tree remainder counts. Activator rail needs 3 sticks (2 directly, 1 in the redstone torch) but the stick recipe makes 4 per batch, so the torch's stick is served by the remainder of the first stick node. The stick recipe favourite must show 3 remaining with an empty inventory, 2 of 3 with one stick in the inventory and disappear with three.",
  "warmupTicks": 60,
  "settleTicks": 15,
  "stepTimeoutSeconds": 30,
  "worldJoinTimeoutSeconds": 120,
  "timeoutSeconds": 300,
